 SECTION  6.14 Transactions With Affiliates . Except for
transactions (a) set forth on Schedule 6.14 , (b) transactions not exceeding $5,000,000 in the aggregate at any time, and (c) transactions that are (i) in the ordinary course of the Loan Parties’ business, (ii) upon
fair and reasonable terms and (iii) no less favorable to Loan Parties than would be obtained in an arm’s length transaction with a non-Affiliate, and (d) transactions that are otherwise
permitted under this Agreement, directly or indirectly enter into or permit to exist any transaction with any Affiliate of any Loan Party. 
 SECTION  6.15 Financial Covenant . Solely during any Availability Block Removal Period, fail to maintain a
Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio of not less than 1.00:1.00, measured monthly as of the last day of each month on a trailing twelve-month basis (commencing with the month immediately following the month for which the Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio was
tested for purposes of delivering an Availability Block Removal Notice pursuant to Section  2.01(b)(i) ).
